  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "hook1",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "These two invented an entire town.",
      "gap": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "hook2",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "And years later, somebody opened a store in it!",
      "gap": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "ny",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "New York, the nineteen-thirties.",
      "gap": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "maps",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Otto and Ernest make road maps, and they have a problem:",
      "gap": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "copy",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "the competition keeps copying them. Every single line!",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "rival1",
      "who": "RIVAL",
      "text": "Thanks for the map, boys!",
      "gap": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "prove",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "And good luck proving it.",
      "gap": 0.1
    },
    {
      "id": "road",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "What are you gonna say? That you own the road?",
      "gap": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "idea",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Until Otto has an idea.",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "otto1",
      "who": "OTTO",
      "text": "What if we just... invent a town?",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "ernest1",
      "who": "ERNEST",
      "text": "A town... that doesn't exist?",
      "gap": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "cows",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "At a lost crossroads, where there's nothing but cows, they draw a town that isn't there:",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "name",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Agloe. Their initials, scrambled.",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "trap",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "It's a trap. If Agloe ever shows up on someone else's map, they copied it.",
      "gap": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "oneday",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "And then one day...",
      "gap": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "zas",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Bam! Agloe shows up on the competition's map.",
      "gap": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "rich",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Otto can already see himself swimming in cash.",
      "gap": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "otto2",
      "who": "OTTO",
      "text": "Ernest, call the lawyers! All of them!",
      "gap": 0.2
    },
    {
      "id": "calm",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "But the competition doesn't even blink.",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "reply",
      "who": "RIVAL",
      "text": "We didn't copy anything. Agloe is real. It even has a store!",
      "gap": 0.3
    },
    {
      "id": "true",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "And it's true. At that crossroads, where there used to be only cows, someone has opened the Agloe General Store.",
      "gap": 0.25
    },
    {
      "id": "why",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "See, the owner saw Agloe on Otto's map, and thought:",
      "gap": 0.15
    },
    {
      "id": "thought",
      "who": "GROCER",
      "text": "Well, if the map says this is Agloe... then Agloe it is.",
      "gap": 0.35
    },
    {
      "id": "pay1",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "Otto invented a town to catch a cheater.",
      "gap": 0.12
    },
    {
      "id": "pay2",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "And his own map made it real.",
      "gap": 0.45
    },
    {
      "id": "button",
      "who": "N",
      "text": "The cows still can't believe it.",
      "gap": 0.7
    }
  ]
}